Z||000000||Smoooooth GT||12-19-2001||10:01 PM||||Hey everybody.... I had someone call me that is not a member of the Forum.. But he's been lurking and he want's me to "Smoooth" his Fiero's... Yes I said "Fiero'S" as in 4 of them... What do you think a "Fair" price would be for "Each" of them.. He has 3 SE's and a GT.... It has cost me around.. $200.00 in material's... and I could probably do one in 10-12 day's..... That would be STEADY WORKING ON IT!!! It has taking me 11 month's to do mine.. But, I have been playing around with it as everyone know I have'nt been in a hurry with it!! What would be "Fair"???  Thank's for the input!!!  Steve<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooooothgtsig_9.gif">                     <BR>      <P><A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A>   Custom Fiberglass Part's from Pat Kalsmith.<P>Technical  Support (903) 825-7744 Steve<BR>Shaved door handles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!||||reg||5
