Z||000004||Cheever3000||12-19-2001||10:29 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Smoooooth GT:<BR><B>It has cost me around.. $200.00 in material's... </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>No, no, no... I distinctly remember you said it was $1000 in materials, plus your labor.  Remember? :wink: :nudge: Remember?  Yeah, that's what it was!  Tell him you need another car to show in your brochure, so you'll do his first one for just the cost of the  materials.<P><BR>||||reg||1
