Z||000007||Cheever3000||12-19-2001||11:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> noone like my Smoooth car!! <HR></BLOCKQUOTE>No, I didn't mean to say you need a <B>different</B> car in your "brochure", but you need an <B>additional</B> one.  Tell him he must consent to letting you use before & after pics of it in your ads.  I'm not kidding, a guy painted my 66 Mustang under this agreement... I got a great paint job for real cheap, and he got something to show potential customers a sample of his work.<P><BR>||||reg||1
